**IMPORTANT**: Generate ONLY the implementation code, NOT test code. Tests are handled separately.

# GOAL
Build an integration with ElevenLabs API for text-to-speech milestone announcements.

# CONTEXT
This tool announces key build events using voice synthesis. It should gracefully degrade to console logging if API keys aren't configured (hackathon demo might not have all keys).

# STACK
- TypeScript
- axios for HTTP requests
- ElevenLabs API v1

# ARTIFACTS
- `tools/voice.ts`: ElevenLabs integration implementation ONLY (no tests in this file)

# FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS
- Accept a text message to announce
- Check if ELEVENLABS_API_KEY is set
- If not set: log to console with 🎙️ emoji and skip API call
- If set: call ElevenLabs TTS API
  - POST to `https://api.elevenlabs.io/v1/text-to-speech/{voice_id}`
  - Use voice_id from env or default
  - Send text + voice settings
  - Get audio back as arraybuffer
  - Log success (don't actually play audio - just confirm generation)
- Always return successfully (never throw)

# NON_FUNCTIONAL_REQUIREMENTS
- Fast timeout (10s max)
- Fail gracefully on API errors
- Don't block main flow
- Clear console output for demo

# INTERFACE
```typescript
export async function announceVoice(message: string): Promise<void>
```

# API_DETAILS
Endpoint: `POST https://api.elevenlabs.io/v1/text-to-speech/{voice_id}`
Headers:
- `xi-api-key`: API key
- `Content-Type`: application/json

Body:
```json
{
  "text": "Build started",
  "model_id": "eleven_monolingual_v1",
  "voice_settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.5
  }
}
```

Response: audio/mpeg arraybuffer

# ERROR_HANDLING
- No API key → log warning, continue
- Network error → log warning, continue
- Rate limit → log warning, continue
- Invalid voice_id → log warning, continue

# TESTS
- Logs to console when API key missing
- Calls correct endpoint when key present
- Handles API errors gracefully
- Never throws errors

# VERIFICATION
✅ Works without API key (degrades gracefully)
✅ Calls ElevenLabs API when configured
✅ Logs clear messages
✅ Never crashes
✅ Tests pass with 80%+ coverage

# NOTES
- Use env vars: ELEVENLABS_API_KEY, ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID
- Always log message to console (even if API succeeds)
- In real demo, actual audio playback is optional
